y in a green-black antique filing drawer, not look like a bright magical card.\nBackground: real transparent alpha everywhere outside the exact folder silhouette, no checkerboard drawn into pixels, no white/black rectangular background.\nConstraints: a single isolated folder cover, NO writing, NO letters or numbers, NO stamp, NO seal, NO logo, NO coat of arms, NO large icon, NO giant tie-string, NO straps across the face, NO folded-over corner, NO holes or tears. Preserve an entirely blank empty top-left label for HTML overlay. Do not crop any part of the folder.",
